Package: netmatchRI
Title: Network-Constrained Matching and Randomization Inference
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhejia", "Dong", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhejia_dong@brown.edu"),
    person("Youjin", "Lee", role = "aut")
  )
Author: Zhejia Dong [aut, cre], Youjin Lee [aut]
Maintainer: Zhejia Dong <zhejia_dong@brown.edu>
Description: User-friendly tools for matching observational data with network
    dependence and testing sharp null hypotheses by randomization inference.
    The package implements covariate-only, single-penalty, and dual-penalty
    matched designs, model-assisted variance bounds, sensitivity grids, and
    paper reproduction helpers for simulation studies.
